\f1\fs22 Halo sipped beer in a bar and reflected on how well his vacation was progressing. All the broadcast screens around him beamed the formal swearing in and commissioning by the Venture Capitalist General of the new Commissioner of Ulyssian Police, one Gerald Hardman, a deep PAPER plant in the force. Halo was so pleased with himself, he felt no urgent appetite for killing, lawn bowls or knitting. He even caught himself being kinder and more respectful to bar waitresses and female customers alike. His newfound loss of misogyny terrified them almost as much as the dulling of his creepy eyes.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>As images of Very Hardman raised his hands across a battery of screens and the recited the Oath of Property Protection and Allegiance to the Status Quo, Halo contemplated the final day trip of his vacation: busting Tony out of Truth\'97a PAPER installation to which Halo had or could acquire all skeleton keys and security passes.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Imagine the temperature of his supernova-grade fury when he later discovered the Elvi had beaten him to it.
